    {
      "source": "SlowMist",
      "text": "According to the SlowMist MistEye security monitoring system, Aventa, which specializes in creating intuitive Web3 utilities for the crypto community, appears to have been attacked, resulting in a loss of approximately 3.9 ETH."
    },
    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "AventaRewardClaim on Ethereum Mainnet let attackers recycle the same IntelliQuant balance through fresh helper contracts and claim AVENTA multiple times on 2025-04-27. Public catalogues place the loss at about $7,000. The claim path paid AVENTA from the caller’s current IntelliQuant balance and did not consume that entitlement or record a one-time claim, so a fresh helper contract could reuse the same economic position for another payout."
    }
